    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">When to get in touch</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950">Urgent repairs and planned roofing work both need the right advice.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700">Some enquiries are urgent because the roof has developed a fault that needs attention quickly. Others are more considered, such as pricing a complete new roof. In both cases, customers need an experienced roofing team that can explain the job clearly and recommend the right solution.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-700">What to expect</p>
